{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":194,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":194,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":566,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/172f5cf85a208844ee036398ecccfe07.png","skin":"魔法","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"圆堂","given_name":"志美子","family_name_jp":"円堂","given_name_jp":"シミコ","family_name_kr":"엔도우","given_name_kr":"시미코","family_name_en":"Endo","given_name_en":"Shimiko","family_name_zh_tw":"円堂","given_name_zh_tw":"志美子","family_name_cn":"圆堂","given_name_cn":"志美子","nick_name":"图书妹","momo_talk_signature":"请在期限内归还书本。","main_relation":12,"relation":null,"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":157,"birthday":"11-30","hobby":" 读书、做书签","designer":"あやみ","illustrator":"あやみ","character_voice":"富田美忧","character_voice_cn":"白灯","release_date":"2021-02-04","release_date_cn":"2023-08-03","release_date_global":"2021-11-09","school":2,"weapon_type":"AR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[37,469],"model":[143,439],"voice":[{"description":"Shimiko_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/GRu9cjnl6yrkN8nsgKOJMt6YUxf2g66W.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Battle_In_1","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿，支援就请交给我吧。","text_original":"支援をお任せください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/RVkUsovpUMCt9Dw3j7OsE7ngO6mCSHhn.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Battle_In_2","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿，总觉得有点激动啊。","text_original":"なんだか少しドキドキしますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/mryC23ns7JrkqHMaLKUKB1DwlRS3kX6v.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"嘻嘻嘻！竖旗咯~","text_original":"ふふふふふっ！フラグが立ちましたよ～。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/fWYQOkkeDWwDEGc3pU2J8PuJCgxPFoVW.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……嘻嘻嘻！我想到了一个好主意！","text_original":"ふふ、うふふ！良いアイデアが浮かびました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/B5OI0lNm8Rq2yffeltO2OStw0IbkUb42.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"书有点少啊。看来需要把书架放满一点。","text_original":"本が足りていませんね。本棚をいっぱいにしないとです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/ZTjGyt4wd23ZWoacQEukgST3g2n3pRa7.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"哇，这个屋子太适合看书啦。","text_original":"わあ、本を読むのには最適なお部屋ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/wbb9WdS5oF2Wgz6qs9oX8xr7R6ZqiAyB.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"啊，这本书我没看过！","text_original":"あっ、この本見たことありません！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/r1CS3m1PTuXDsDSaAzde9FqbcyF1MjL2.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"知识，真是心灵的食粮啊。","text_original":"知識は心の糧ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/NAE5nYO4rZv4a2nA8lb4MP4gq4XGdDPz.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿，好有意思。","text_original":"ふん、ふん…。面白いです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/LzJgEQSOpibYkqkEzyTOTML8uP3WdAJt.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"哦——！好感动！","text_original":"おぉ～！感動しました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/L8390EUf4dMaAnrBvjP0gZLfNnmeLgEL.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"啊——！这是……爱吗……？","text_original":"うわぁっ、これは…愛？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/muTRIPT5fqCyxoSnUQvc7bgHqhagcGRf.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"各位，请多读书啊！","text_original":"皆さん、もっと読書してください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/T7YV2rUDSIsLOQWjvkh2OrErCOv9GRA2.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"和我一起来读书吧！","text_original":"私と一緒に読書しましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/NABJiy65U3ddaMXCdBKYLTIDMO27SpKv.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"这也算是书本的力量。","text_original":"これもまた、本の力です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/TJTRr4RRiluKIcPe0WJaTIKdumzYJotM.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，借书逾期未还的人请做好心理准备哦。","text_original":"ふふ、返却期限を延滞してしまった方は覚悟してくださいね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/RUJTultEzOKikjzWblx0mdEOc6vXKErU.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"嘿嘿，真没办法。那我出发啦~！","text_original":"仕方ないですね。行きます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/GKWXa2Zy56mWF9eLOHa8ZWii8xIpN5WP.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"您需要我是吗？","text_original":"私のことが欲しいのですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/pWwPj3VROLcdWz8LVlfY4asaoUhamr6k.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"就和书里的故事一样，我们的故事也要开始了！","text_original":"本の中の物語のように、私たちの物語が、始まります!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/FsSKyQ1WAUUbVMsR9Htga8XqybGvp9Za.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"老师，非常感谢！","text_original":"ありがとうございます、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/FRK1lMZ6pVI6xssp5tGNKMlifr6iZIbS.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"书读的越多，就会变得越强！","text_original":"本を読めば読むほど、強くなれます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/rXN4nsy4mldQ9t3catNRLMhDzdlPit3C.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"书本中包含了世界上所有的智慧！","text_original":"本には、世界中の知恵が盛り込まれています！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/zWgHmrhdn71oBYumLxtORHLhjhdRGZDv.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我的知识又增加啦！","text_original":"また知識が増えましたねー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/yz5ofminwKVT7Kwu4C2w507N1qnitaWv.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"拿到零花钱之后我会先去买书，然后才会买衣服和吃的。","text_original":"お小遣いをもらったら、まず本を買います。服や食事はその次です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/2P4i9PfiWMW8KTGBzD8Z0hozdSK8Ek21.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"您问我喜欢读什么书？嗯……我不挑剔的，不管什么书我都会看……","text_original":"どんな本が好きか、ですか？うーん…私は好き嫌いなく全部読みますから…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/jpVOIrAj7VZYOKdLQPvhjPx2pwVbJed3.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"老师，我不建议您看那本书哦。因为您再往下翻4页，主角就莫名其妙地死掉了。 ……呃，我是不是剧透了？","text_original":"先生、その本はおすすめしませんよ。そこから4ページ先で、主人公があっけなく死んでしまいますから …あれ、私ネタバレしちゃいました？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/eB4SQneDXA4q4v4Dguf7l1VFo9UfBgPn.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"这儿也应该再多放点书的……要不，我带几本推荐的书过来吧？","text_original":"ここにも、もう少し本があった方が良さそうですが…。私が何冊か、おすすめの本をお持ちしましょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/4so6qhqR2u2Tj92wd4Cab1ajABMBT9nF.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"真希望大家都能多读点书……","text_original":"みんなにもっと、本を読んでほしいのですが…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/9WNnEJwy0QYyEPcMR8jg2md0HsQvrIs9.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师！之前我给您的书您都看完了吗？","text_original":"お帰りなさい、先生！前にお渡しした本は読んでみましたか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/50pDy7hDD0sO1FTzkVUkKQ7Zc7utKQOJ.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天给您推荐些什么书好呢？","text_original":"今日はどんな本をおすすめしましょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/bKLV37WnQH8fcnDodMMuXA1ZMeN6wkvq.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"爱是什么？我知道哦，我从书里学到了很多！","text_original":"愛がどんなものか、知ってます！本でしっかり学びましたから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/NlWVECUapf0swjGuH9AUDZC2GDnQwSJ4.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"嘿嘿，感觉好幸福！简直就像是刚刚读完了一本好书！","text_original":"うふふ。まるで良い本を読んだ後の様な、幸せな気持ちです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/DEVLvcAnftubKUlliQyDAlAm6i5nDdiF.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"也有一些东西是我从书本中学不到的，比如说关于老师的事情。","text_original":"書物では学べなかったものがありました。例えば、先生のこととか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/fnguVoqWkVg8vC7nU9FFgUWwMnlgm6HG.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"能够学到新的知识，是一件非常值得高兴的事情。老师，您想了解多少关于我的事情呢？","text_original":"知らなかった事を知る事ができるのは、とても嬉しいことです。……先生は、私について…どれぐらい知りたいですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/GVmHfPZRTOA80AdDjrKbjSX8DJFlQ5ic.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻，虽然我真的好爱看书……不过每次生日大家送我的礼物都是书，总感觉有点可惜。 希望老师今天能送我特别一点的礼物！","text_original":"ふふっ、私は心から本が好きですけど…。誕生日のたびに本ばかりもらうのは、少しだけ残念でした。 今日は、先生からの特別なプレゼントが欲しいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/LhxLsFMqchVPeGTBBzBPKT9IlEjmap5P.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！您有什么想看的书，请尽管告诉我吧！","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます。先生！欲しい本がありましたら、何でもおっしゃってくださいね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/1ZjBnxzaL0xaCq05hVHn4c2xlhUguZ6D.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节开始了！嘻嘻，得准备怪奇小说和恐怖小说特辑啦。","text_original":"ハロウィーンが始まりました！ふふっ、怪奇小説やホラー小説の特集を準備しないとですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/QhjqrKrAodHD5iTvS223M5RrmtywzCnZ.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"恭祝新春快乐！今年也请您多多指教了。","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございます！今年も一年、よろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/2PpiFA3vGdUyK9cj6boshXEObHRBmXDJ.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐～老师，今天是一个很特别的日子哦！ 这种日子能和老师在一起…………真的很开心，嘿嘿！","text_original":"メリークリスマ～ス。先生、今日は本当に特別な日なんですよ！ こんな日に先生と一緒にいられて…嬉しいです、ふふっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/0EeIq7SuW2TMky27bdAYYRiOB2aEWcvr.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"えっと……ぐ、偶然ですね。まさかぴったり同じタイミングで……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/gWwaEMnlNJwfQ4XawpX7RIxBzFp9FJk7.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先に見つけて、先生にご報告したかったのですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/K2l3SduNPiW2T84qtMitCi1p9oSBLUGx.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……いえ。先に手をかけたのは私かもしれません……よね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/8IPC4Wh1gCFwRnJGmyCXIymATAp4FqzR.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"うーん、どうしましょう。 どうしてもと仰るのなら、 譲っても良いのですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/vffZvhfpBSbFrXL1efVPgR0QPlWri6d8.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……なんて、冗談です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/c2XS1hkgDm9gUp0PZURDuexRBtwjZDVw.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"貸し出し記録を付けて、 すぐお渡しします。無事に 見つかって何よりです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/GMJcmybq7DYyhDmmW4ByWUsQPOO0Kgr0.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"どうでしたか？ 図書館でのこういった時間も…… 何だか楽しくありません？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/lu6l88yxQzBNDDmhhziyRcWl3uX5TCFA.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"他では味わえない良さと 言いますか、この場所なら ではと言いますか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/W2zopGHLrq4qRKBmTfILKqyl1QxmOjs5.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……ですので、 ぜひこれからも。 お好きなタイミングで ここに来てください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/AviIdEJdEHiWFKxtbsjmIiv0LpLZNXE9.ogg"},{"description":"Shimiko_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……私、 待ってますから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/1H7iIf4ATRf4G8dOBj6k7MaZKWn1mZW1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"shimiko_title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/2FugZdMAWICIcWnRAe5eT6KxSMaait0F.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_titleb.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/7CcjligVA39UeSyDqzG1cs3q6Lc5ZOQD.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_battle_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿，支援就请交给我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/EEZ5B8u81efRzOMHpcA2wB6BmN92xYIk.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_battle_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿，总觉得有点激动啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/STUbkdyDCTzb57eREVwt21J51zAsbJuq.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_cafe_act_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"嘻嘻嘻！竖旗咯~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/Y7YtYhApu4qoBykSoMl4BSl2JTjDS8zY.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_cafe_act_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……嘻嘻嘻！我想到了一个好主意！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/BQv4amnTnyK0EyWiSoKn0FaiHVL2N69l.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"书有点少啊。看来需要把书架放满一点。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/GSi3dfdaizDN2zmkK9nhg5bM2KZB3IrB.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"哇，这个屋子太适合看书啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/CGmaC5VH20VicpDO6wWw1ByFQDQ3Hl4m.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"啊，这本书我没看过！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/RiMjoqs944w7DmutqhvRDR9OyL263XhE.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_commonskill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"知识，真是心灵的食粮啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/QETQE5BEuaVaFreFBmdOHnfW1u2tKEBj.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿，好有意思。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/6vHG6zdWE1BKOGjpS2IXOkth3cSVN9C9.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"哦——！好感动！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/M2vOgQm30nKZD9zg61MZAowj69jhQqEB.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"啊——！这是……爱吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/rhHezLDdQvzHLFN4Ys7B7LNnWjoepG36.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"各位，请多读书啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/esAybywTsC8ry4A953taHt6o12WDeMpC.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"和我一起来读书吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/UjCUgCZ6GZzFdKjyeD79bwqjF7yQcv7F.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这也算是书本的力量。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/x299NKwPO1LSaVvQbzgtQIeJMPpYUckC.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exweapon_get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，借书逾期未还的人请做好心理准备哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/to6QSfe6PSPYeoRHg3CDZOnFMfbrFwQ5.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_formation_in_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"嘿嘿，真没办法。那我出发啦~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/c1BJop8w6TP9eBMNlcPLih6szvCLtSEx.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_formation_in_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"您需要我是吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/7P9B9mAISKQ5oUBHEKYu9aKJ3MxGSrPa.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"就和书里的故事一样，我们的故事也要开始了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/eFSuBSv0pl8aNB2CjVZevhM1NdnYYB2S.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"老师，非常感谢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/iRGbHQzTEo0KGXaCF7Nh2plTVvBStPr6.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"书读的越多，就会变得越强！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/0f3aA4BqbyyXo5ry8WIbE5DncRDTG16x.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"书本中包含了世界上所有的智慧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/TVxF4GDt1ff0y6ClfM87Z5hn3kyBPY0h.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"我的知识又增加啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/BR0ABHcKoatnKZSqTfxzEjKX8qf5llFa.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"拿到零花钱之后我会先去买书，然后才会买衣服和吃的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/sP6xPG9Gi5rojjoPWDSlBUuZIX88NHuZ.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"您问我喜欢读什么书？嗯……我不挑剔的，不管什么书我都会看……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/YyK7eO52ocKEwUtbXBMOtFtkKAOIFiJZ.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师，我不建议您看那本书哦。因为您再往下翻4页，主角就莫名其妙地死掉了。 ……呃，我是不是剧透了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/jG9K7ABTo2jsCEOCliRqnIOdvpzh5S8j.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"这儿也应该再多放点书的……要不，我带几本推荐的书过来吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/Qgkx6rysUHRQpC0waPMLsv7YoBN2L9AY.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"真希望大家都能多读点书……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/SqvM4wFSp8AYunRKpyD7Q60lBrwFixVH.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_login_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师！之前我给您的书您都看完了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/hxZ3lBlSmXsUUw845ooagLCb8OvH8Qnt.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_login_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今天给您推荐些什么书好呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/RloWF3b2iv8a517mKk1Lpr2xQqHSxGz1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"爱是什么？我知道哦，我从书里学到了很多！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/qm1VqBIqyQOcp0L6HD588mdaaraZLmQe.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"嘿嘿，感觉好幸福！简直就像是刚刚读完了一本好书！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/6XCHfj8xUeL5PGG4kVGf5UdciPNChJh5.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"也有一些东西是我从书本中学不到的，比如说关于老师的事情。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/LcrTUInL5IdMDBIAORi6IwVxmlWT5KkA.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"能够学到新的知识，是一件非常值得高兴的事情。老师，您想了解多少关于我的事情呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/rOpoPBGokiEGrLib6Ym06euktMsfuovq.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻，虽然我真的好爱看书……不过每次生日大家送我的礼物都是书，总感觉有点可惜。 希望老师今天能送我特别一点的礼物！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/ul27Fw7qCtCo7sILgHEitdjZxlD850Be.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！您有什么想看的书，请尽管告诉我吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/QgsAylWc8rzLi1BOfNY4PZB6bofU9OM3.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节开始了！嘻嘻，得准备怪奇小说和恐怖小说特辑啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/qa2wD6SzTNwuPiDuCjrtowvBrTUJaEjY.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"恭祝新春快乐！今年也请您多多指教了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/zSIzseNIr1b6skEOe78DKETmZXBLiaiZ.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐～老师，今天是一个很特别的日子哦！ 这种日子能和老师在一起…………真的很开心，嘿嘿！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/dKtZn9cmk578s7WNydrE291FJ1xBST0A.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师，中秋节快乐！我看过的诗集里有很多以中秋节为主题的作品呢。我最喜欢的是这句： “但愿人长久,千里共缠绢。”","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/Fe2ed9mc1pulGHdWWqIWUxUuwCLmTCsJ.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/IdpEME4a55BC7unB1YjpqrKeIP0fcoBG.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝您新春快乐。今年也一起展开一段精彩的旅程吧，不管是在书中，还是在生活中。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/UwwArPq4lH1LOoLIm6o8d8GvVVvTNbLq.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊…… 真，真巧啊。 没想到居然会……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"我本来想先找出来， 然后告诉老师的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"……反正，先拿到的人是我吧。 对不对？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯~该怎么办呢~ 非常需要的话， 让给您也不是不行……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嘿嘿，开玩笑啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"盖好出借记录章就马上给您。 能找到真是太好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"怎么样？ 在图书馆度过的这段时间…… 是不是也很有趣？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"在其他地方可体验不到哦…… 是这里的特色……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯……那以后， 如果有需要请随时来找我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……我会等您的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/cn/shimiko_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"shimiko_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/shimiko_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/shimiko_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/shimiko_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/shimiko_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%9C%86%E5%A0%82%20%E5%BF%97%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%90/original/shimiko_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"shimiko_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.w